# Aero needs NO API keys.
#
# Online search and search suggestions go through YouTube's InnerTube JSON API
# (the same client API the YouTube / YouTube Music web players use) with no key
# and no quota, and audio is resolved on-device by the native NewPipe extractor.
# There is no YouTube Data API dependency: no Google Cloud project, no
# EXPO_PUBLIC_* secret, nothing to configure for online playback.
#
# Lyrics are equally keyless: they are fetched from LRCLIB
# (https://lrclib.net), an open lyrics database with a public JSON API —
# no key, no quota, nothing to configure.
#
# Copy this file to `.env` (or `.env.local`) only if a future feature genuinely
# needs configuration.

